  "description": "港股（香港市場）股票篩選與分析平台：即時／歷史行情、多維度篩選、評分模型、視覺化儀表板、策略回測、警報通知與投資組合追蹤",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "server/index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node server/index.js",
    "test": "node --test scripts/test-core.mjs",
    "test:regime": "node --test scripts/test-regime.mjs",
    "test:fundamental": "node --test scripts/test-fundamental.mjs",
    "smoke": "node scripts/smoke.mjs",
    "check-ui": "node scripts/check-ui.mjs",
    "check-p1": "node scripts/check-p1.mjs",
    "check-p2": "node scripts/check-p2.mjs",
    "check-p3": "node scripts/check-p3.mjs",
    "enrich-names": "node scripts/enrich-names.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": ["hong-kong", "stock", "screener", "backtest", "dashboard"],
  "author": "",
  "license": "ISC",
  "dependencies": {
